Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.03,0:00:06.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you arrange for him too, Mason-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only time I frightened you \Nwas three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have you dying out here, \Nso I came to keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why did you attack us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was because Izumi-san \Ntold me to toughen you up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't "a little," \Nwe were at death's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! How could you have been so reckless with children?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough! Stop griping about \Nsomething that happened ages ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He probably just stole his parents' boat or something and drifted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's the case—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! That light!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's an alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:02.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You turned your \Nown body into stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with this guy?! \NWhere are his clothes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! \NHe's just a child, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:25.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he might have been \Ncoming after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At your ages, are you already such wanted men?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:37.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from? Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there, \Nyou don't have to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those haven't been cooked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad that you two made it back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go killing us off so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:32.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So? Has your teacher forgiven you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's probably going to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We disobeyed what she taught us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:48.77,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Even though we knew we were nothing more than one part of the flow of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we became conceited, saying that the world was within us, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and tried to alter that flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's something \Nshe'll never forgive us for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Let go of me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something funny about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.31,0:05:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everybody makes mistakes, don't they? \NI'm going to go tell her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll ask her if she's never \Nmade any mistakes before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Winry! That's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei realizes that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So don't worry, Winry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:38.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:43.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.27,0:05:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if he has lost his memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei trusts him too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she did take him \Nto the police, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They asked her to watch after him while they gathered information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope he's just a lost little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:08.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The meat is too tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.61,0:06:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd better not do this, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei locked it with alchemy. If we open it, she'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, make sure to put this back the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terrific! Everyone was dead, \Nso it got boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They aren't dead. \NThey're just asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we play? I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look! You played around like this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}was{\i0} you who watched us \Nthat whole time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:25.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An animal's life is not a plaything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm playing! I'm playing! I'm playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:30.13,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, be quiet! You'll wake them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:31.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do that too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:47.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me! Earlier on the island, \Nyou transmuted a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your clothes were also made by transmutation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, your tone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy transmuted without using a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only ones who can do that are myself and Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet, Sensei pretended like she didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's definitely weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try untying it with alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:10.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it off, take it off, take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:14.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, this boy really doesn't have anything to do with those others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, I remember having seen his face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:20.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as though I've \Nseen him somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! What'd you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:42.33,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,There's no way I could transmute a person's body and a bed together in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're making too much noise for me to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:58.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't like that, Sensei! We didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:02.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true! Brother is quite the liar, but he's telling the truth today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, thanks a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:10.64,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I know. I don't remember having taught you \Nany such careless alchemy as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:13.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Making Chimeras by crossing two lives with each other aside, that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me down! Let me down from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you remember what your original form was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just have to remember \Nwhat your original form was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take your time... Take your time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You moronic pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of commotion were you \Ntrying to create by scaring this child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we were worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he was the guy \Nwho came after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just who is it that's after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They called themselves... homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for always \Ncoming by like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But with your new job, are you sure it's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I work at home, \Nso my time is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scieszka-san, um, if you're still investigating the incident with Maes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:44.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm not involved in \Nanything that dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not all that impulsive, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.06,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:54.04,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to Hughes-san's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong of me to slip over to a close friend's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can \Nshow your face there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not when you aren't even investigating the cause of that close friend's death
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and can only think about \Ngetting yourself promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now look, missy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are copies of the materials
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that Hughes-san was looking into \Nright before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason that he was killed \Nhas to be in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your posting to Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was easy for me to say, but I don't get this at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:59.99,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,This is a list of all the external calls that were connected to the Central Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no sort of code here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To the reception clerk... \NTo the Ministry of Justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To the Führer's secretary's office...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:15.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't have you lose \Ntrack of them, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty busy myself here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.74,0:12:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their master lives in \Na town named Dublith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They might still be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go there \Nand have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay to leave the Greed matter to Lust and Gluttony, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys still haven't given up on the Philosopher's Stone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arrange for them to have the opportunity to create one once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:45.95,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,For being the youngest among us, \Nyou sure do give orders like you're all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like to have those boys create a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we can't have them sticking their noses into that Ishbal business. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't those homunculi create their own Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said that they couldn't make it themselves—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:09.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that they couldn't use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, this child is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you shouldn't be able to reform your own body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:21.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no matter what kind of alchemy you're using, and yet he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, he has transmuted without a transmutation circle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just like you and Brother do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:28.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! Not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, you remember, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gateway, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, \Nit's because I saw it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was truth, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.51,0:14:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, I couldn't understand what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:23.48,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,It was as if there was this incredible amount of information being directly mashed into my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, suddenly I understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything about alchemy that I hadn't known up until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:34.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It felt like I was just \None step away from arriving
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at my imperfect theory of human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more time! \NShow it to me one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth was in there! \NThe thing that I've been looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Equivalent exchange? \NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.99,0:15:14.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A toll?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's been taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... This isn't what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:45.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, it's all my fault... Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:49.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understood when I was inside that gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:53.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I acted now, there was still time. If I acted now, I could still...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give him back. He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both my arms... My heart... I'll give them to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just give him back! \NHe's my only brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.57,0:16:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the time I came to, \NI was already in this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and what had been Mom was no longer there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw the truth there. That's why I can transmute without a transmutation circle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and was able to bond Al's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:48.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think of it as truth, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it is, isn't it? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was more along the lines of a magic trick, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I just remembered. \NI have a hunch that I saw him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's so, then he isn't human!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to check. Everything else comes afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to go near \Nthat child. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to go make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys don't know, do they? How homunculi are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen! \NHow good of you to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:47.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Alex Louis Armstrong, \Nwelcome you with my utmost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around \Nand get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Breda...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:18:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, you never know when he's \Ngoing to strike. Brace yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The major isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's with the officer assigned to the Court-Martial Office
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who has taken over for \NBrigadier General Hughes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and they're off conducting \Nan investigation somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this other person \Nwho's taking over for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I recall, it was Frank...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Lt. Colonel Frank Archer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a man dedicated to his military duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a good thing to be, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By military duties, \NI mean that the man enjoys war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:41.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel, \NI'm sorry to ask you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know where the Elric brothers went. What are you, a broken record?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no evidence that they even went south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is evident that they went south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have someone watching them? Those brothers are not traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:19:01.87,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I just don't have any intention of letting them run around free, the way Mustang does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the forthcoming battle, \Nyou understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:09.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but Izumi-san told me not to let you out, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:14.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She asked to have a boat ready for her, \Nso maybe the island again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The island? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All righty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:29.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, let's let your hair out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, sorry, but since we can't come out of our room...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al? What did you guys do to this boy? \NHe's terrified of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:44.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm... Anyhow, Winry, this may sound strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's something \NI need to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about that boy's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:54.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean this? I was surprised too. \NWhat in the world could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the base of his right arm \Nand left leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:11.77,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Brother, you said you saw it, right? \NHis face, on the other side of the doorway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't good. \NIf Izumi-san finds out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be finished right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:26.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys! Your teacher told you \Nnot to come near this boy, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like he said, we'll be \Nfinished with this right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way... something like this could be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was an equivalent exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom's body, in exchange for my leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al's soul, as it was fading away, in exchange for my arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was an equivalent exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the scar from a fox bite...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this my arm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be that that boy's arm and leg are...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.24,0:23:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:44.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 30: "Assault on South Headquarters"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am still a dog of the military!
